    "UIName": "Skinwalker II",
    "Id": "chassisdef_skinwalker_ii_SKW-2-E",
    "Name": "Skinwalker II",
    "Details": "The E configuration of the Skinwalker II OmniMech is the greatest departure from older Stormcrow loadouts, combining a HAG-20 and an ER PPC into a highly effective anti-air configuration. The HAG can make flak attacks while the ER PPC punches large holes through enemy armor, and deep ammunition bins allow the HAG to carry special ammunition without compromising its main mission. A Nova CEWS in the center torso completes the loadout.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Skinwalkerii"
  },
